  volume    =  37,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "141--154",
  abstract  = "BACKGROUND: Practice-changing clinical trials for novel
               therapeutic regimens administered in the neoadjuvant setting have
               been reported for multiple cancer types, bringing this treatment
               strategy to the forefront for patients with high-risk surgically
               resectable disease. Previously, tumor-type- or
