  number    = "1 Pt B",
  pages     = "224--231",
  abstract  = "Phosphorylation-mediated signaling plays a crucial role in nearly
               every aspect of cellular physiology. A recent study based on
               protein microarray experiments identified a large number of
               kinase-substrate relationships (KSRs), and built a comprehensive
