  number    = "D1",
  pages     = "D504--D510",
  abstract  = "The SIGnaling Network Open Resource 2.0 (SIGNOR 2.0) is a public
               repository that stores signaling information as binary causal
               relationships between biological entities. The captured
               information is represented graphically as a signed directed
               graph. Each signaling relationship is associated to an effect
