               studies demonstrate that CIDD-8633 effectively blocks PDAC tumor
               growth in preclinical mouse models. Additionally, combining
               CIDD-8633 with gemcitabine enhanced its efficacy synergistically.
               Mechanistically, CIDD-8633 treatment induces pro-apoptotic genes
               in PDAC cells. These findings position DDR2 as a promising
