               different origins and etiologies of human PDACs, with the
               aggressive Methylationlow/IFNsignhigh subtype potentially
               targetable by agents blocking intrinsic IFN signaling.
               SIGNIFICANCE: The mutational landscapes of PDAC alone cannot
