               microenvironment formation. Given the importance of fibroblast
               activation in PDAC pathology, it is critical to recognize the
               mechanisms involved in the transformation of normal fibroblasts
               in the early stages of tumorigenesis. To this aim, we first
               identified the proteins released from the pancreatic cancer cell
